  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support ICJ-S 08</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d ICJ-S 08</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har sedan 2001 haft avtal med Internationella  Juristkommissionens svenska sektion (ICJ-S). ICJ-S arbetar inom bl.a. demokratisk samh&#xe4;llsstyrning med syfte att st&#xe4;rka lokala  m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsorganisationer och institutioner inom r&#xe4;ttssektorn i Sidas samarbetsl&#xe4;nder. Detta till&#xe4;gg till ICJ-S ges f&#xf6;r att  m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra en successiv utfasning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has had an agreement with the International Jurist Commission, Swedish Section (ICJ-S), since 2001. ICJ-S is working in the area of democratic governance in order to strengthen local human rights organizations and institutions within the justice sector in Sida&apos;s partner countries. This amendment to the agreement with ICJ-S is approved in order to allow a gradual phasing out.</narrative>
  </description>
